# Merge quality gate (mandatory)

**Never merge a PR to `main` if any required check is red or pending.**
**Never `git push origin main` to bypass that gate.**

## Before every merge

```bash
gh pr checks <number>
npm run sonar:gate -- --status --pr <number>
```

Do not merge until **all** of the following are `pass` (or `skipping` when expected):

| Check | When required |
|---|---|
| **SonarCloud Code Analysis** | Always (GitHub required check on `main`) |
| **SonarCloud quality gate** | Always when that workflow runs (waits on the App check) |
| **Lint and build** | Web paths changed (see `web-quality.yml`) |
| **Build debug APK** | Android paths changed (see `android-native.yml`) |
| **Polyglot checks** | Polyglot paths changed (see `polyglot-quality.yml`) |

A missing path-filtered job is **not** a failure. If SonarCloud is `fail` or pending, **stop**.

Do not push to `main`. Do not bypass branch protection.

Owner: keep `SonarCloud Code Analysis` required. Do **not** require path-filtered jobs on every PR.
